sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant M as Memory
    participant P as Planner
    participant W as Web Search
    participant PA as Paper Search
    participant V as Video Search
    participant SV as Source Verifier
    participant S as Synthesizer
    participant H as Human Approval
    participant D as Doc Generator

    U->>O: minta deep research topik
    O->>M: baca learner profile & memory
    M-->>O: konteks belajar
    O->>P: buat subplan riset
    P-->>O: daftar subquery
    par Parallel search
        O->>W: cari web
        O->>PA: cari paper
        O->>V: cari video
    end
    W-->>O: hasil mentah
    PA-->>O: hasil mentah
    V-->>O: hasil mentah
    O->>SV: verifikasi sumber
    SV-->>O: status akses & kualitas
    O->>S: sintesis materi
    S-->>O: ringkasan + sitasi
    O->>H: minta persetujuan
    H-->>O: disetujui / direvisi
    O->>D: generate materi belajar
    D-->>U: dokumen + kartu recall
